14. EPISODE / CONTENT DISCUSSION EXPERIENCE

The episode/content discussion experience is central to Hallyu.

A user should be able to understand:

What am I looking at?

What episode/content is this?

What are people saying?

Will I be spoiled?

Spoiler protection must be taken seriously.

Potential spoiler content should be hidden behind a clear interaction.

Example:

Spoiler hidden

Tap to reveal.

The reveal should be deliberate and animated.

The user should not accidentally expose a major plot point simply by scrolling.

